@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+# N27 finite-screen CPU handoff
+
+Preparation is closed to execution until root reviews the exact final commit, source bridge, native proof and external authorities. The accepted Phase A helper/test bytes remain unchanged; its note describes that earlier helper-only stage. All live policy/provider/descriptor/quality/selection semantics except the explicit update assignment remain frozen.
+
